cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "The Network of Fame: Network Analysis on the Pantheon Dataset"
abstract: >
  Network analysis of the Pantheon biographical dataset containing 11,340 historical
  figures connected by 126,153 directed edges derived from Wikipedia co-citations.
  Explores network structure, centrality indices (degree, betweenness, PageRank, HITS),
  community detection, and factors associated with historical popularity using ERGM models.
